{"headword":"אַרְגָּמָן","parent_lexicon":"BDB Dictionary","content":{"senses":[{"definition":"<strong>n.</strong>[<strong>m.</strong>] <strong>purple, red-purple</strong>, i.e. <strong>purple thread & cloth (</strong>Assyrian <em>argamannu</em> COT <a data-ref=\"Exodus 25:4\" href=\"/Exodus.25.4\">Ex 25:4</a>, Arabic <span dir=\"rtl\">أَرْجَوَانٌ</span>, Aramaic <span dir=\"rtl\">ܐܰܪܓܘܳܢܳܐ</span>, cf. <a data-ref=\"BDB, אַרְגֹּב\" href=\"/BDB,_אַרְגֹּב\", dir=\"rtl\">אַרְגְּוָן</a> supr.; etym. dub.; possibly Skr. <em>râgaman</em>, adj. <em>red, reddish</em>, from <em>râga</em>, red colour, so Benary cf. Thes Add <sup>111</sup> RobGes; vid. MV; Thes earlier, from <span dir=\"rtl\">רגם</span>; but prob. loan-word, cf. also Lag<sup>BN 205</sup>; Pers. <span dir=\"rtl\">ارغوان</span> is also cited by PS<strong>)</strong>—form always as above—"},{"senses":[{"definition":"<em>purple thread</em>, cf. especially <a data-ref=\"Exodus 35:25\" href=\"/Exodus.35.25\">Ex 35:25</a>; <a data-ref=\"Exodus 39:3\" href=\"/Exodus.39.3\">39:3</a>; <a data-ref=\"Esther 1:6\" href=\"/Esther.1.6\">Est 1:6</a>;"},{"senses":[{"definition":"mostly Ex (P) with ref. to the hangings of tabernacle, the ephod, etc.; seld. alone; c. <span dir=\"rtl\">תְּכֵלֶת</span>, <em>violet</em> (q.v.), <span dir=\"rtl\">תּוֹלַעַת שָׁנִי</span>, <span dir=\"rtl\">(מָשְׁזָר) שֵׁשׁ</span>, (also <span dir=\"rtl\">עִזִּים</span>) <a data-ref=\"Exodus 25:4\" href=\"/Exodus.25.4\">Ex 25:4</a>; <a data-ref=\"Exodus 26:1\" href=\"/Exodus.26.1\">26:1</a>, <a data-ref=\"Exodus 26:31\" href=\"/Exodus.26.31\">31</a>, <a data-ref=\"Exodus 26:36\" href=\"/Exodus.26.36\">36</a>; <a data-ref=\"Exodus 27:16\" href=\"/Exodus.27.16\">27:16</a>; <a data-ref=\"Exodus 35:6\" href=\"/Exodus.35.6\">35:6</a>, <a data-ref=\"Exodus 35:25\" href=\"/Exodus.35.25\">25</a>, <a data-ref=\"Exodus 35:35\" href=\"/Exodus.35.35\">35</a>; <a data-ref=\"Exodus 36:8\" href=\"/Exodus.36.8\">36:8</a>, <a data-ref=\"Exodus 36:35\" href=\"/Exodus.36.35\">35</a>, <a data-ref=\"Exodus 36:37\" href=\"/Exodus.36.37\">37</a>; <a data-ref=\"Exodus 38:18\" href=\"/Exodus.38.18\">38:18</a>, <a data-ref=\"Exodus 38:23\" href=\"/Exodus.38.23\">23</a>; <a data-ref=\"Exodus 39:24\" href=\"/Exodus.39.24\">39:24</a> (on text v. Di) v <a data-ref=\"Exodus 39:29\" href=\"/Exodus.39.29\">29</a>; with these + <span dir=\"rtl\">זָהָב</span> <a data-ref=\"Exodus 28:5\" href=\"/Exodus.28.5\">28:5</a>, <a data-ref=\"Exodus 28:6\" href=\"/Exodus.28.6\">6</a>, <a data-ref=\"Exodus 28:8\" href=\"/Exodus.28.8\">8</a>, <a data-ref=\"Exodus 28:15\" href=\"/Exodus.28.15\">15</a>; <a data-ref=\"Exodus 39:2\" href=\"/Exodus.39.2\">39:2</a>, <a data-ref=\"Exodus 39:3\" href=\"/Exodus.39.3\">3</a>, <a data-ref=\"Exodus 39:5\" href=\"/Exodus.39.5\">5</a>, <a data-ref=\"Exodus 39:8\" href=\"/Exodus.39.8\">8</a>; om. <span dir=\"rtl\">שֵׁשׁ מ׳</span> <a data-ref=\"Exodus 28:33\" href=\"/Exodus.28.33\">28:33</a>; <a data-ref=\"Exodus 39:1\" href=\"/Exodus.39.1\">39:1</a>; also of temple-hangings, with <span dir=\"rtl\">תְּכֵלֶת</span>, <span dir=\"rtl\">בּוּץ</span> & <span dir=\"rtl\">כַּרְמִיל</span> <a data-ref=\"II Chronicles 3:14\" href=\"/II_Chronicles.3.14\">2 Ch 3:14</a>; cf. <a data-ref=\"II Chronicles 2:13\" href=\"/II_Chronicles.2.13\">2:13</a> (v. also <a data-ref=\"II Chronicles 2:6\" href=\"/II_Chronicles.2.6\">2:6</a> v. sub <a data-ref=\"BDB, אַרְגָּמָן\" href=\"/BDB,_אַרְגָּמָן\", dir=\"rtl\">אַרְגְּוָן</a>)."}],"num":"a."},{"senses":[{"definition":"as indicating wealth & luxury of Tyre, c. <span dir=\"rtl\">שֵׁשׁ</span>, <span dir=\"rtl\">רִקְמָה</span>, <span dir=\"rtl\">תְּכֵלֶת</span> <a data-ref=\"Ezekiel 27:7\" href=\"/Ezekiel.27.7\">Ez 27:7</a>; c. <span dir=\"rtl\">רִקְמָה</span> & <span dir=\"rtl\">בּוּץ</span> v <a data-ref=\"Ezekiel 27:16\" href=\"/Ezekiel.27.16\">16</a> (as articles of commerce); also in Persia, c. <span dir=\"rtl\">בּוּץ</span> <a data-ref=\"Esther 1:6\" href=\"/Esther.1.6\">Est 1:6</a>."}],"num":"b."}],"num":"1."},{"senses":[{"definition":"<em>purple cloth</em>, chiefly of garments, <span dir=\"rtl\">בֶּגֶד א׳</span> <a data-ref=\"Numbers 4:13\" href=\"/Numbers.4.13\">Nu 4:13</a>; <a data-ref=\"Judges 8:26\" href=\"/Judges.8.26\">Ju 8:26</a>; <span dir=\"rtl\">וְתַכְרִיךְ בּוּץ וְא׳</span> <a data-ref=\"Esther 8:15\" href=\"/Esther.8.15\">Est 8:15</a>, <span dir=\"rtl\">שֵׁשׁ וְא׳ לְבוּשָׁהּ</span> <a data-ref=\"Proverbs 31:22\" href=\"/Proverbs.31.22\">Pr 31:22</a>; <span dir=\"rtl\">תְּכֵלֶת וְא׳ לְבוּשָׁם</span> <a data-ref=\"Jeremiah 10:9\" href=\"/Jeremiah.10.9\">Je 10:9</a>; also <span dir=\"rtl\">מֶרְכָּבוֹ א׳</span> <a data-ref=\"Song of Songs 3:10\" href=\"/Song_of_Songs.3.10\">Ct 3:10</a>; in simile, of woman’s hair <a data-ref=\"Song of Songs 7:6\" href=\"/Song_of_Songs.7.6\">Ct 7:6</a>."}],"num":"2."}]},"rid":"BDB00806","strong_numbers":["713"],"next_hw":"אַרְדְּ","prev_hw":"אַרְגְּוָן","all_cited":true,"quotes":[],"GK":["763"],"TWOT":["157b"],"parent_lexicon_details":{"name":"BDB Dictionary","language":"heb.biblical","to_language":"eng","text_categories":[],"source":"BDB Dictionary","attribution":"F. Brown, S. Driver & C. Briggs","index_title":"BDB","version_title":"A Hebrew and English lexicon of the Old Testament, by Francis Brown. With the co-operation of S. R. Driver and Charles A. Briggs. Oxford, 1906","version_lang":"en","should_autocomplete":true}}